Private DockerHub repository-ku Jenkins CI/CD use panni image push panna mudiyum.

Naan simple ah step-by-step sollren 👇

🔹 Requirements

DockerHub account (private repo create pannirukanum)

DockerHub Access Token (password-ku badhila)

Jenkins server (Docker installed)

Jenkins credentials la DockerHub creds add pannirukanum

🔹 Step 1: DockerHub la Private Repository

DockerHub → Create Repository

Name: username/myapp

Visibility: Private

🔹 Step 2: DockerHub Access Token create pannu

DockerHub →
Account Settings → Security → New Access Token

✔ Copy panni vachiko

🔹 Step 3: Jenkins la Credentials add pannu

Manage Jenkins → Credentials → (global) → Add Credentials

Kind: Username with password

Username: DockerHub username

Password: Access Token

ID: dockerhub-creds

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

jenkin pipeline script paste and build now
